Type: Package
Package: hedgeroot
Title: Data Management Foundation for Hedgerow Trading System
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Maximilian", "Scholz", , "dev.scholz@mailbox.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Standalone data fetching, validation, and storage for
    financial data without trading dependencies. Integrates with quantmod
    for data fetching and data.table for high-performance operations.
